    "title": "Which ex-high school standouts from Upstate South Carolina area will play on Saturday, Dec. 13? - Upstate SC News",
    "text": "These ex-Upstate South Carolina area high school standouts will participate in competitions on Saturday, Dec. 13.\nBrock Cherry\nUSC Aiken Pacers\nGuard\nFreshman\n6′3″ 200\nWren High School\nHometown: Piedmont\nNext Game: vs. Flagler Saints, Saturday, Dec. 13, 3:30 p.m.\nCal Godfrey\nAnderson Trojans\nForward\nSophomore\n6′7″\nWren High School\nHometown: Easley\nNext Game: vs. Carson-Newman Eagles, Saturday, Dec. 13, 4 p.m.\nJake Norris\nNavy Midshipmen\nJunior\n6′3″ 230\nWren High School\nHometown: Piedmont\nNext Game: vs. Army Black Knights, Saturday, Dec. 13, 3 p.m.\nJason Slack\nMary Baldwin Fighting Squirrels\nCenter\nSophomore\n6′6″\nFranklin Prep Academy\nHometown: Columbia\nNext Game: vs. Bridgewater Eagles, Saturday, Dec. 13, 2 p.m.\nLogan McConnell\nNewberry Wolves\nJunior\n6′0″ 175\nT.l. Hanna High School\nHometown: Anderson\nNext Game: vs. Ferris State Bulldogs, Saturday, Dec. 13, 12 p.m.",
